{"model":"step35","text":"<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Atlas Operations Manual</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f4f6f8;--surface:#fff;--text:#1a1a1a;--muted:#555;--accent:#005f73;--accent2:#0a9396;--border:#dbe3e8;--focus:#e76f51;--shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\nhtml{scroll-behavior:smooth}\nbody{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.55}\na{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline}\na:focus,button:focus,input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px}\nheader{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:var(--surface);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:0.75rem 1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\n.brand{font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--accent)}\n.search{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:.5rem}\n.search input{padding:.5rem .75rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.375rem;min-width:220px}\n.search button{padding:.5rem .75rem;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:.375rem;cursor:pointer}\n.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1rem;max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto}\n.sidebar{position:sticky;top:4.5rem;align-self:start;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.5rem;padding:.75rem;max-height:calc(100vh - 6rem);overflow:auto}\n.sidebar nav a{display:block;padding:.35rem .5rem;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;border-radius:.25rem}\n.sidebar nav a:hover,.sidebar nav a:focus{background:var(--bg);color:var(--accent)}\n.status{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.5rem;padding:.75rem 1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}\n.status .metric{font-weight:600}\nmain{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.5rem;padding:1.25rem}\nsection{padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\nsection:last-child{border-bottom:none}\nh2{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:.5rem}\np{margin-bottom:.6rem}\ndl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:.5rem 1rem;margin:.75rem 0}\ndt{font-weight:600;color:var(--accent2)}\ndd{margin-left:0;color:var(--muted)}\ntable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:.75rem 0;font-size:.95rem}\nth,td{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.45rem .6rem;text-align:left}\nth{background:var(--bg);font-weight:600}\npre{background:#0d1b2a;color:#e0e6ed;padding:.75rem;border-radius:.375rem;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,monospace;font-size:.9rem}\n.actions{display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin-top:.5rem}\nbutton{padding:.45rem .75rem;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);border-radius:.375rem;cursor:pointer}\nbutton.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}\nbutton.danger{background:#9b2226;color:#fff;border-color:#9b2226}\n.toast{position:fixed;bottom:1rem;right:1rem;background:#001219;color:#fff;padding:.6rem 1rem;border-radius:.375rem;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s;pointer-events:none}\n.toast.show{opacity:1}\n@media(max-width:800px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sidebar{display:none}header{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}.search{margin-left:0}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n<div class=\"brand\">Atlas Operations Manual</div>\n<div class=\"search\">\n<input type=\"search\" id=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search sections...\" aria-label=\"Search sections\">\n<button id=\"searchBtn\" type=\"button\">Search</button>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n<aside class=\"sidebar\" aria-label=\"Section navigation\">\n<nav id=\"toc\"></nav>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<div class=\"metric\">Total Sections: <span id=\"total\">400</span></div>\n<div class=\"metric\">Appendix Tables: <span id=\"appendixCount\">0</span></div>\n<div class=\"metric\">Status: <span id=\"statusText\">Ready</span></div>\n</div>\n<main id=\"content\">\n<section id=\"sec1\"><h2>1. Introduction</h2><p>This manual documents operational procedures for the Atlas platform. It covers configuration, monitoring, troubleshooting, and safety protocols. Read this document before performing any maintenance tasks.</p><p>All personnel must follow the steps in the order presented. Deviations require written approval from the operations lead. Keep this document accessible at all times.</p><dl><dt>Scope</dt><dd>Platform-wide operational guidance</dd><dt>Audience</dt><dd>Engineers, operators, auditors</dd><dt>Version</dt><dd>4.2.1</dd><dt>Updated</dt><dd>2025-10-12</dd></dl><table><tr><th>ID</th><th>Component</th><th>Status</th><th>Owner</th><th>Review Date</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>A1</td><td>Core API</td><td>Stable</td><td>S. Rao</td><td>2025-11-01</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>A2</td><td>Ingestion</td><td>Active</td><td>M. Chen</td><td>2025-11-15</td><td>Pending scaling</td></tr><tr><td>A3</td><td>Storage</td><td>Degraded</td><td>J. Park</td><td>2025-10-20</td><td>Disk IOPS</td></tr><tr><td>A4</td><td>Auth</td><td>Stable</td><td>L. Gomez</td><td>2025-12-01</td><td>MFA rollout</td></tr><tr><td>A5</td><td>Monitoring</td><td>Active</td><td>T. Ali</td><td>2025-10-30</td><td>Alerts tuned</td></tr><tr><td>A6</td><td>Backup</td><td>Stable</td><td>R. Singh</td><td>2025-11-05</td><td>Daily snapshots</td></tr></table><pre>atlas-cli status --all --verbose</pre><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\">Acknowledge</button><button type=\"button\">Print</button></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec2\"><h2>2. Safety Protocols</h2><p>Safety is the highest priority. Always wear required personal protective equipment when entering data centers. Follow lockout-tagout procedures before touching hardware.</p><p>Report incidents immediately using the incident form. Do not attempt repairs beyond your certification level. Emergency contacts are posted near each equipment rack.</p><dl><dt>PPE</dt><dd>Required in all server rooms</dd><dt>LOTO</dt><dd>Mandatory for power work</dd><dt>Reporting</dt><dd>Within 15 minutes</dd><dt>Escalation</dt><dd>On-call manager</dd></dl><table><tr><th>ID</th><th>Hazard","tokens":[43274,15096,1281,267,3816,51704,1018,85786,44106,1281,33778,15,26,3816,85786,2329,1281,69406,4,3445,1281,12356,70654,27239,14,6069,16057,31,19,3816,104101,32,4690,9646,25257,30374,1718,10212,1018,94344,1018,28,9056,93,610,40723,27462,72,22,72,24,72,26,29,610,94506,27462,52396,29,610,2067,27462,19,67,19,67,19,67,29,610,79,4679,27462,20295,29,610,439,1591,27462,14984,72,5817,29,610,439,1591,20,27462,18,67,31550,24,29,610,41567,27462,70,2304,21,71,26,29,610,70133,27462,71,4307,72,4287,29,610,126507,28,18,223,20,5438,223,26,5438,60367,10,18,14,18,14,18,14,18,16,3019,38357,12,93,7353,116505,28,41567,37057,29,59033,28,18,29,53916,28,18,1778,6541,93,88352,11543,17129,59073,74690,1778,7193,93,18742,36941,28,27824,59653,14162,42123,68322,14,33373,5670,22095,14,35936,7544,14,14505,127949,37361,5550,26909,634,80985,29,23734,28,5241,56668,40723,3171,10323,28,5241,56668,2067,3171,1836,47904,28,19,16,2315,1778,67,93,10323,28,5241,56668,439,1591,3171,2067,81141,28,47706,1778,67,28,70133,14,10911,28,70133,101379,28,70133,14,13933,28,70133,14,76969,28,70133,93,606,1836,28,21,5438,7527,4627,56668,70133,3171,606,1836,14864,3284,28,20,5438,1778,16771,93,6988,28,318,40196,29,16126,28,18,29,92,57249,28,1457,29,23734,28,5241,56668,94506,3171,41567,35865,28,19,5438,7527,4627,56668,41567,3171,53916,28,18,16,2402,3812,223,19,3812,29,9887,28,28695,29,60339,41779,28,18631,29,71553,28,19,3812,29,28695,97358,28,49660,29,7353,48219,28,5241,56668,126507,38357,6229,3537,93,18742,29364,28,8996,29,18742,17809,28,19,16,1069,3812,29,10323,28,5241,56668,